==Swedish==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmq-osw|sv}} ''kviker'' or ''kvikker'', {{etyl|non|sv}} ''[[kvikr]]'' (whence also Norwegian ''[[kvik]]'' and ''[[kvikk]]'', Icelandic and Faeroese ''[[kvikur]]''), from {{etyl|gem-pro|sv}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*kwikwaz}}, whence also English ''[[quick]]''. Ultimately from {{etyl|ine-pro|sv}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*gʷih₃wós||alive}}.

